tyle='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Test Name<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=90 valign=top style='width:67.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Results<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=114 valign=top style='width:85.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Unit<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=174 valign=top style='width:130.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Bio. Ref. Interval<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <td width=348 valign=top style='width:261.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>CHIKUNGUNYA VIRUS ANTIBODY - IgM<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=90 valign=top style='width:67.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=114 valign=top style='width:85.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=174 valign=top style='width:130.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Negative<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:12.6pt'>\r\n  <td width=348 valign=top style='width:261.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.6pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=90 valign=top style='width:67.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.6pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=114 valign=top style='width:85.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.6pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=174 valign=top style='width:130.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.6pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>CLINICAL\r\nNOTES<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Chikungunya\r\nis an infection caused by the chikungunya virus (CHIKV). Symptoms include fever\r\nand joint pains. These typically occur two to twelve days after exposure. Other\r\nsymptoms may include headache, muscle pain, joint swelling and a rash. Symptoms\r\nusually improve within a week; however, occasionally the joint pain may last\r\nfor months or years. The risk of death is around 1 in 1,000. The very young,\r\nold and those with other health problems are at risk of more severe disease.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>The\r\nvirus is spread between people by two types of mosquitoes: Aedes albopictus and\r\nAedes aegypti. They mainly bite during the day. The virus may circulate within\r\na number of animals including birds and rodents.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Diagnosis\r\nis by either testing the blood for the virus\u2019s RNA (PCR) or antibodies to the\r\nvirus.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"612.0pt 792.0pt","margin":"148.5pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 40.5pt"}}